    "技术学了大半，还有一两项不会（常见是反手、发力）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Has learned most techniques but still missing one or two (often backhand or power)"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ज़्यादातर तकनीक सीख ली, पर एक-दो अभी बाकी हैं (अक्सर बैकहैंड या पावर)"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sudah menguasai sebagian besar teknik, tapi masih kurang satu-dua (biasanya backhand atau tenaga)"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "技術はほぼ習得、まだ 1〜2 項目できない（よくあるのはバックハンドや力の伝え方）"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "기술을 대부분 익혔지만 한두 가지가 부족해요(주로 백핸드나 파워)"
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sudah belajar kebanyakan teknik tetapi masih kurang satu dua (biasanya backhand atau kuasa)"
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "เรียนเทคนิคมาเกือบครบ ยังขาดอีกหนึ่งหรือสองอย่าง (มักเป็นแบ็คแฮนด์หรือการส่งแรง)"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Đã học gần hết kỹ thuật nhưng còn thiếu một hai thứ (thường là trái tay hoặc dùng lực)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "技術學了大半，還有一兩項不會（常見是反手、發力）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "技术特点开始明显：有自己的得分手段和打法" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Developing a distinct style: has their own ways to win points"
          }
