    "拉、吊、杀都能轻松完成，球速一般，落点凭感觉" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clears, drops and smashes come easily; average pace, placement by feel"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "क्लियर, ड्रॉप और स्मैश आसानी से; रफ़्तार औसत, प्लेसमेंट अंदाज़े से"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clear, dropshot, dan smash mudah dilakukan; kecepatan biasa, penempatan masih mengandalkan feeling"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "クリア、ドロップ、スマッシュは楽に打てる。球速は普通、コースは感覚まかせ"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "클리어, 드롭, 스매시를 쉽게 하지만 구속은 보통이고 코스는 감에 의존해요"
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clear, dropshot dan smash mudah dilakukan; kelajuan sederhana, penempatan ikut rasa"
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ลูกโด่ง หยอด ตบ ทำได้สบาย ความเร็วลูกปานกลาง ตำแหน่งลูกตามความรู้สึก"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Phông cầu, bỏ nhỏ, đập cầu đều dễ dàng; tốc độ trung bình, điểm rơi theo cảm giác"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拉、吊、殺都能輕鬆完成，球速一般，落點憑感覺"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拉吊杀动作一致，对手很难提前判断" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clears, drops and smashes look the same, so opponents can't read them"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "क्लियर, ड्रॉप और स्मैश एक जैसे दिखते हैं, विरोधी पढ़ नहीं पाते"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gerakan clear, dropshot, dan smash terlihat sama, jadi lawan sulit membacanya"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "クリア、ドロップ、スマッシュのフォームが同じで、相手が読めない"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "클리어, 드롭, 스매시 동작이 같아서 상대가 미리 읽기 어려워요"
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clear, dropshot dan smash kelihatan sama, jadi lawan sukar membacanya"
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ท่าลูกโด่ง หยอด ตบ เหมือนกัน คู่แข่งอ่านล่วงหน้ายาก"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Phông, bỏ nhỏ, đập cùng một động tác, đối thủ khó đoán trước"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拉吊殺動作一致，對手很難提前判斷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
