    "昵称和头像会展示给球友，手机号不会" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your nickname and photo are shown to players; your phone number isn't"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "आपका निकनेम और फ़ोटो खिलाड़ियों को दिखते हैं; फ़ोन नंबर नहीं"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nama panggilan dan fotomu ditampilkan ke pemain lain; nomor HP-mu tidak"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ニックネームと写真はプレイヤーに表示されますが、電話番号は表示されません"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "닉네임과 사진은 플레이어에게 표시되지만 휴대폰 번호는 표시되지 않아요"
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nama panggilan dan foto anda ditunjukkan kepada pemain; nombor telefon tidak"
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ชื่อเล่นและรูปโปรไฟล์จะแสดงให้ผู้เล่นเห็น แต่เบอร์โทรจะไม่แสดง"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Biệt danh và ảnh đại diện sẽ hiển thị cho người chơi khác, số điện thoại thì không"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "暱稱和頭像會顯示給球友，手機號碼不會"
          }
        }
      }
    },
