    "杀球有暴击音，按对方站位用重杀、劈杀、点杀" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Smashes crack; picks hard, sliced or stick smashes based on the opponent's position"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "स्मैश में ज़ोरदार आवाज़; विरोधी की पोज़िशन देखकर हार्ड, स्लाइस या स्टिक स्मैश चुनते हैं"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Smash berbunyi keras; memilih smash keras, smash potong, atau stick smash sesuai posisi lawan"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "スマッシュは快音が響き、相手の位置に応じて強打、カットスマッシュ、ショートスマッシュを打ち分ける"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "스매시 타구음이 강하고, 상대 위치에 따라 강스매시, 커트 스매시, 스틱 스매시를 골라 써요"
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Smash berbunyi kuat; pilih smash keras, smash potong atau stick smash ikut kedudukan lawan"
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ตบมีเสียงดังสนั่น เลือกตบหนัก ตบตัด หรือตบจิ้มตามตำแหน่งคู่แข่ง"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Đập cầu nổ giòn; chọn đập mạnh, đập cắt hay đập dí tùy vị trí đối thủ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "殺球有爆擊聲，依對方站位用重殺、劈殺、點殺"
          }
        }
