    "爽约次数较多，之后约球需先付 AA 才能确认。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Due to frequent no-shows, you'll need to pay your share upfront to confirm games."
