    "能用反手打，但只能到中场或中前场；对手一打你的反手你就被动" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Can hit backhand, but only to mid or front court; once opponents target your backhand you’re under pressure"
          }
